OL,3,GNEWSAHow boxing inspired a play about
OL,4,Amen's mental health
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor many athletes, years of training
OL,7,Fcan provide a routine, a purpose and an
OL,8,Fidentity - but what happens when it all
OL,9,Fstops?
OL,11,FThat question is at the heart of a new
OL,12,Fplay which explores men's mental health
OL,13,Fthrough the world of boxing.
OL,15,FThe Corner Man follows a fighter forced
OL,16,Fto confront life outside the ring after
OL,17,Fspending years dedicated to the sport.
